Tier change · 2026-11-20T05:58Z · #35610 merged at 509289c6a and added `scripts/pm/record-recognisers.mjs` to the governed register. This PR edits that file, so `check-governed-merges --pr 35753` on current main now reads GOVERNED, Tier H (296 changed lines, under 3000). The queue guard refused the group that held it (run 44683495267: no authorized APPROVED review, enqueued by the relay account). The head `c398e480` is unchanged, L1-a ACCEPT 7031619244 covers it, and all checks on the head are green. The seat enqueues nothing more until approval.

@os-zhuang, could you review and approve `c398e480`? The change makes the `--land` dogfood gate read every card a fold PR ties (`Fixes` and `Part of`), so a fold PR with two `Fixes` lines no longer gets refused (#35651). Once you approve, the seat lands it. If you'd rather enqueue it yourself, that works too.
